Package: ai-sandbox-server
Version: @aiSandboxServerVersion@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: openjdk-21-jre-headless | openjdk-21-jdk-headless, docker.io | docker-ce, unzip, openssh-client
Maintainer: ai-sandbox <noreply@example.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/HaroldHormaechea/ai-sandbox
Description: ai-sandbox mTLS management server (UC03)
 mTLS-gated REST + WebSocket API for the ai-sandbox multi-session
 sandbox kit. Ships the Spring Boot server (aisandbox-server.jar),
 the install / PKI / allowlist CLI (aisandboxctl.jar), the bundled
 host-script set + container build context, the systemd unit, and
 the OpenAPI spec.
 .
 After installing, run `sudo aisandboxctl pki init` to mint the
 self-signed server cert + key and provision the operator-managed
 directory tree, then `sudo aisandboxctl secrets seed` and
 `sudo aisandboxctl client mint <name>` before enabling the unit.
